     2| * IVX "Check Supabase" staged diagnostic (owner-only).
     3| *
     4| * Runs a REAL, observable workflow against the live Supabase project and returns
     5| * each stage as discrete execution evidence — never a generic "please wait":
     6| *   1. connection    → DNS/HTTPS reachability of the project REST host
     7| *   2. authentication → service-role key accepted by PostgREST
     8| *   3. query          → live SELECT against the authoritative jv_deals table
